{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>亞太區主要股市下跌。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市連跌四日，跌穿6,300點。半導體板塊跑輸大市，SK海力士和三星電子急挫逾百分之4。</p><p></p><p>台灣股市三連跌，曾跌逾百分之1，收市險守49,000點大關。澳洲股市則兩連升。日本股市假期休市。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T09:02:50.739443+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T08:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T08:57:44.458675+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T08:57:44.458675+00:00","content_hash":"c6eb41fd4c882e7c79b59441170006d3ba063f9c86567f8533fc7440f4cb6845","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}